00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:22.180
ED HOFFMAN: Yeah.

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.020
A service mesh describes
your microservices

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.695
and the applications
and their interactions.

00:00:27.695 --> 00:00:30.690
Istio helps you with the traffic
management, observability,

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:31.740
and security.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:34.430
Istio helps in decoupling your
application code from the PAP

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:36.370
form in policy controls.

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.800
If you're the GM, and
Kubernetes is manager,

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.642
Istio is your hitting,
pitching, and bench coaches.

00:00:41.642 --> 00:00:42.360
